---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Where the guide popup lands after a successful submit. It carries a direct download as
// well as the "check your inbox" line, so a slow or blocked delivery never leaves someone
// with nothing after they have handed over an address.
const GUIDE_PATH = '/guides/5-golden-quarter-google-ads-tactics-q4.pdf';
---

<Layout
  title="Your Q4 Playbook Is On Its Way | Visible Ads"
  description="Your copy of the 5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics playbook is on its way to your inbox."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="bg-white px-4 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-8 items-start">
        <img
          src="/images/guides/q4-playbook-cover.png"
          alt="Cover of the 5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics playbook"
          width="1191"
          height="1685"
          class="w-40 sm:w-48 rounded-lg shadow-xl ring-1 ring-navy/10"
        />

        <div>
          <div id="guide-sent-ok">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-success bg-success/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Check your inbox
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-4">
              Your playbook is on its way
            </h1>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3">
              We have emailed you a link to <strong>5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics for Q4</strong>.
              It usually lands within a minute.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
              If it is not there, check the promotions or spam folder. Or just grab it here.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- The worker redirects here with delivery=failed when the guide email did not
               go out, so the page must not claim it did. The download below still works. -->
          <div id="guide-sent-failed" class="hidden">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber bg-amber/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z" /></svg>
              Download it here
            </div>

            <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-navy leading-tight mb-4">
              Here is your playbook
            </h1>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3">
              We could not get the email out just now, so grab
              <strong>5 Golden Quarter Google Ads Tactics for Q4</strong> straight from the
              button below.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
              We have your details, so we will follow up and make sure a copy reaches your inbox too.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a
              href={GUIDE_PATH}
              download
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-cta text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-electric transition-colors shadow-lg"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M4 20h16" /></svg>
              Download the playbook
            </a>
            <a
              href="/free-ads-audit"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-white text-navy font-semibold rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:text-electric transition-colors"
            >
              Book a profit audit
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy mb-3">While you are here</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">
          The playbook covers the structure. If you want the numbers behind it, these two go
          deeper on running Q4 for profit rather than revenue.
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/roas-vs-profit" class="block p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-1">ROAS vs profit</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">Why a 4x ROAS can still lose money, and the POAS calculator that shows it.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/blog/break-even-roas" class="block p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-electric hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-1">Break-even ROAS by margin</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">The number to cap Black Friday bidding against, worked out from your own margin.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    if (window.location.pathname.replace(/\/+$/, '') !== '/guide-sent') return;
    const failed = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('delivery') === 'failed';
    document.getElementById('guide-sent-ok')?.classList.toggle('hidden', failed);
    document.getElementById('guide-sent-failed')?.classList.toggle('hidden', !failed);
  });
</script>
